t need to be met under the program rules. </p> What courses you''ll study <p><strong>Complete 144 units comprising:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>108</strong> units for all <strong>Core courses</strong>, and</li><li><strong>6</strong> units for all <strong>Work integrated learning</strong>, and</li><li><strong>30</strong> units for <strong>Electives</strong></li></ul> <p><strong>Complete 108 units for ALL of the following:</strong></p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Course name</th> <th>Course code</th> <th>Units</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/agri-1000/">Agricultural Production</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>AGRI1000</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/agri-1002/">Agricultural Systems</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>AGRI1002</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/agri-1003/">Soils and Landscapes</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>AGRI1003</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/agri-2004/">Soil and Water Resources 2</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>AGRI2004</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/agri-2005/">Crop and Pasture Production</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>AGRI2005</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/agri-2006/">Agricultural Biochemistry</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>AGRI2006</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/agri-2010/">Agribusiness</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>A