cceed in the future of business. You will be equipped with core knowledge across essential disciplines of business including accounting, people management, strategic decision making and corporate law. </p> <p>Learn to navigate dynamic global business environments and consider broad societal challenges. You will emerge as an independent learner capable of solving problems and responding with flexibility. </p> <p>Contemporary learning experiences across the degree are underpinned by industry engagement. You will have the opportunity to engage in an internship or placement and explore professional pathways in sectors aligned with your interests.</p> Key features <ul><li>Learn industry-informed marketing techniques from world-class academics. </li><li>Build power skills and core business knowledge to future-proof your career. </li><li>Gain essential enterprise knowledge to graduate career ready. </li><li>Enjoy the flexibility to study electives across different disciplines. </li><li>Discover research insights from the Ehrenberg-Bass Institute, the world’s largest centre for marketing research. </li><li>Connect with community and industry through an internship. </li></ul> Why Bachelor of Business? <p>Marketing is more than sales – it’s a science.</p> <p>Study a degree based on advanced marketing techniques and informed by industry leaders. Build the skills and knowledge necessary for a career in the marketing industry. Develop an in-depth understanding of marketing principles, consumer insights, brand development and advertising. Be equipped with core knowledge across essential disciplines of business including people management and strategic decision making. Engage in an industry internship which will enable you to explore professional pathways in sectors aligned with your interests.</p> <p>Learn from curriculum informed by industry and the world-renowned Ehrenberg Bass Institute of for Marketing Science. Graduate with the ability to understand markets, develop strategies and grow revenue for businesses. </p> Overview <p>Adelaide University’s Bachelor of Business majoring in Marketing is grounded in real-world research. You’ll master advanced marketing techniques, ensuring you graduate career ready. Courses are designed in collaboration with world-class academics and industry leaders. </p> <p>You will develop the practical skills and in-depth knowledge in areas like marketing principles, consumer insights, brand development and advertising. </p> <p>Build power skills such as resilience, curiosity and entrepreneurship to succeed in the future of business. You will be equipped with core knowledge across essential disciplines of business including accounting, people management, strategic decision making and corporate law. </p> <p>Learn to navigate dynamic global business environments and consider broad societal challenges. You will emerge as an independent learner capable of solving problems and responding with flexibility. </p> <p>Contemporary learning experiences across the degree are underpinned by industry engagement. You will have the opportunity to engage in an internship or placement and explore professional pathways in sectors aligned with your interests.</p>',
