.edu.au/study/courses/econ-3802/"> Professional Career Development (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <a href="#work-integrated-learning"> 1 Work integrated learning </a> <p> Work Integrated Learning </p> <p> WIL courses give you real‑world experience as part of your degree. </p> Units 6 <p> <a href="#program-electives-year-3">Program electives Year 3</a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#program-electives-year-3"> 1 Program electives Year 3 </a> </p> Units 6 <p> <a href="#program-electives-year-3">Program electives Year 3</a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#program-electives-year-3"> 1 Program electives Year 3 </a> </p> Units 6 <p> <a href="/study/electives/">University-wide electives</a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="/study/electives/">1 University-wide electives</a> </p> <h5> Semester 2</h5> Units 6 <p> <strong>ECON3006</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/econ-3006/"> Econometrics (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type 1 Core courses - Program core <p> Core course </p> <p> Core courses are compulsory and build the essential knowledge for your degree. </p> Units 6 <p> <strong>ECON3801</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/econ-3801/"> Economic Analysis (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type 1 Core courses - Program core <p> Core course </p> <p> Core courses are compulsory and build the essential knowledge for your degree. </p> Units 6 <p> <a href="#program-electives-year-3">Program electives Year 3</a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#program-electives-year-3"> 1 Program electives Year 3 </a> </p> Units 6 <p> <a href="#common-core">Common core</a> 1 </p> Course type <a href="#common-core"> 1 Common core </a> <p> Common core </p> <p> Common core courses are interdisciplinary courses that build key graduate capabilities. </p> Year 4 <h5> Semester 1</h5> Units 6 <p> <strong>ECONX401</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/econx-401/"> Econometric Theory (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type 1 Core courses - Program core 