rses/musi-3012/"> Music Theatre Portfolio (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#core-courses"> 1 Core courses </a> </p> Units 6 <p> <strong>MUSI3011</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/musi-3011/"> Music Theatre Production 3 (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#core-courses"> 1 Core courses </a> </p> Units 6 <p> <strong>MUSI3009</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/musi-3009/"> The Project (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#core-courses"> 1 Core courses </a> </p> <h5> Semester 2</h5> Units 6 <p> <strong>MUSI3008</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/musi-3008/"> Music Theatre Performance 3B (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#core-courses"> 1 Core courses </a> </p> Units 12 <p> <strong>MUSI3010</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/musi-3010/"> The Graduation Musical &amp; Industry Showcase (12 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#core-courses"> 1 Core courses </a> </p> Units 6 <p> <a href="/study/electives/">University-wide electives</a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="/study/electives/">1 University-wide electives</a> </p> Enrolment information <p> Find details about the rules and notes that apply to your program, along with other essential information required for successful enrolment. Supplementary supporting resources may also be provided where applicable. </p> <p>Some programs include additional enrolment advice. If available for your program, it will be displayed here.</p> Courses <p>Listed here are all the courses that contribute to your program, including elective options that can be chosen. These courses come together to form your study plan. Courses fall into different categories, each of which have specific unit values that need to be met under the program rules. </p> What courses you''ll study <p><strong>Complete 144 units comprising:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>114</strong> units for all <strong>Core courses</strong>, and</li><li><strong>6</strong> units from <strong>Discipline courses</strong>, and</li><li><strong>24</strong> units for <strong>Electives</strong></li></ul> <p><strong>Complete 114 units for ALL of the following:</strong></p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Course name</th> <th>Course code</th> <th>Units</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/musi-1005/">Music Theatre Performance 1A</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>MUSI1005</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/musi-1010/">Music Theatre Performance 1B</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>MUSI1010</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/musi-1015/">Music Theatre Production 1A</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>MUSI1015</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/musi-1016/">Music Theatre Production 1B</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>MUSI1016</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/musi-1900/">Music Theatre Musicianship 1A</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>MUSI1900</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/musi-1901/">Music Theatre Musicianship 1B</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>MUSI1901</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/musi-2004/">Music Theatre Performance 2A</a> </td> <td> <p>Course code</p> <p>MUSI2004</p> </td> <td> <p>Units</p> <p>6</p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td> <p>Course name</p> <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/musi-2008/">Music Theat