. </p> <h5> Semester 2</h5> Units 6 <p> <strong>EDUC1018</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/educ-1018/"> Languages Education and First Nations Knowledges (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#core-courses"> 1 Core courses </a> </p> Units 6 <p> <strong>EDUC2106</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/educ-2106/"> Inclusive Education and Responsive Teaching in Early Years (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#core-courses"> 1 Core courses </a> </p> Units 6 <p> <strong>EDUC2107</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/educ-2107/"> Learning about Reading in Early Years (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#core-courses"> 1 Core courses </a> </p> Units 6 <p> <a href="#electives">Elective</a> 1 </p> Course type <a href="#electives"> 1 Elective </a> <p> Electives </p> <p> A flexible course choice within your degree. </p> Year 3 <h5> Semester 1</h5> Units 6 <p> <strong>EDUC2111</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/educ-2111/"> Learning about Literacies and Text Production in Early Years (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#core-courses"> 1 Core courses </a> </p> Units 6 <p> <strong>EDUC3001</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/educ-3001/"> Exploring Mathematics through Play (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#core-courses"> 1 Core courses </a> </p> Units 6 <p> <strong>EDUC3057</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/educ-3057/"> Humanities and Social Science Education in Early Years (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#core-courses"> 1 Core courses </a> </p> Units 6 <p> <strong>EDUC3058</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/educ-3058/"> Languages Education in Early Years (6 units) </a> 1 </p> Course type <p> <a href="#core-courses"> 1 Core courses </a> </p> <h5> Semester 2</h5> Units 6 <p> <strong>EDUC3056</strong> | <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/courses/educ-3056/">