ur regional campuses in <a href="https://adelaideuni.edu.au/why-adelaide/campuses/mount-gambier-campus/">Mount Gambier</a> and <a href="https://adelaideuni.edu.au/why-adelaide/campuses/whyalla-campus/">Whyalla</a>.</p>',
