UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>Our Graduate Certificate in Immersive Media Technologies is a six-month (or part-time equivalent) program that will prepare you to advance your skills and pursue new career opportunities. </p><p>Discover the different types of immersive media technology platforms. Develop foundational media skills. Study design principles and hone your technical knowledge. Gain essential industry insights and create a practical project plan. </p><p>Our degree prepares you for the immersive media field by providing a comprehensive curriculum that combines both creative and technical practices. You’ll build essential skills for success in the industry. </p><p>Make your mark in the growing immersive media landscape. Change the way the world delivers and consumes content. Take advantage of the global skills shortage and get ready for an exciting creative future. </p> Key features <ul><li>Explore the global immersive media industry. </li><li>Gain insight into ethical considerations and challenges. </li><li>Learn basic technical skills to create digital assets. </li><li>Broaden your knowledge in design theory and game-engine capabilities. </li><li>Understand the importance of ergonomics and human-computer interface design. </li><li>Access globally recognised academics with links to industry. </li></ul>  ',
