g and Midwifery Board of Australia (NMBA).</li></ul><li>A completed bachelor degree (AQF level 7) or higher from a recognised higher education institution; AND</li><li>Hold or be eligible to hold registration with the Nursing and Midwifery Board of Australia (NMBA).</li><p><strong>Additional Requirements</strong></p><p>Applicants seeking to commence in the Critical Care specialisation will be required to submit a <a href="https://adelaideuni.edu.au/content/dam/adelaideuniversity/documents/study/pdfs/nursing_pg_criticalcare_clinical-support-form_au.pdf">Statement of Clinical Support</a> completed and endorsed by the applicant''s Clinical Manager.</p> <p><b>Recognition of prior learning</b></p> <ul><li>Adelaide University is committed to recognising the contribution of students’ prior learning towards their program requirements. Credit may be granted for formal, informal, and non-formal learning. Visit the <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/how-to-apply/entry-pathways/credit/">Credit for previous study</a> page for more information.</li><li>Answer a few simple questions with our online <a href="https://apps.adelaide.edu.au/public/creditassessor/">Credit Assessor</a> to see what credit you could get.</li></ul> <p><b>Recognition of prior learning</b></p><ul><li>Adelaide University is committed to recognising the contribution of students’ prior learning towards their program requirements. Credit may be granted for formal, informal, and non-formal learning. Visit the <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/how-to-apply/entry-pathways/credit/">Credit for previous study</a> page for more information.</li><li>Answer a few simple questions with our online <a href="https://apps.adelaide.edu.au/public/creditassessor/">Credit Assessor</a> to see what credit you could get.</li></ul><li>Adelaide University is committed to recognising the contribution of students’ prior learning towards their program requirements. Credit may be granted for formal, informal, and non-formal learning. Visit the <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/how-to-apply/entry-pathways/credit/">Credit for previous study</a> page for more information.</li><li>Answer a few simple questions with our online <a href="https://apps.adelaide.edu.au/public/creditassessor/">Credit Assessor</a> to see what credit you could get.</li>',
