tps://adelaide.edu.au/study/how-to-apply/entry-pathways/credit/">Credit for previous study</a> page for more information.</li><li>Answer a few simple questions with our online <a href="https://apps.adelaide.edu.au/public/creditassessor/">Credit Assessor</a> to see what credit you could get.</li></ul><li>Adelaide University is committed to recognising the contribution of students’ prior learning towards their program requirements. Credit may be granted for formal, informal, and non-formal learning. Visit the <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/how-to-apply/entry-pathways/credit/">Credit for previous study</a> page for more information.</li><li>Answer a few simple questions with our online <a href="https://apps.adelaide.edu.au/public/creditassessor/">Credit Assessor</a> to see what credit you could get.</li>',
