UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>Statistical knowledge is essential across almost every industry that you, as a graduate, will enter. </p><p>You’ll develop the advanced skills and knowledge desired by industry in our Graduate Certificate in Statistics. Critically analyse and solve advanced problems in mathematics and statistics. Get equipped with the tools to effectively visualise data to create insightful analyses and impactful communication. </p><p>Whether you’re from a biology, psychology or engineering background, our program will provide you the statistics specialisation to pursue different careers. Experiment with cutting-edge software and learn to use programming languages like R, building the skills to uncover hidden patterns. </p><p>Revolutionise online shopping or tackle challenges in healthcare and environmental science. Use statistical models to make a meaningful impact and gain a competitive edge in your career. </p> Key features <ul><li>Study contemporary, future-focused courses in statistics. </li><li>Develop deep knowledge in statistical sciences. </li><li>Complete four core courses over six-months of full-time study. </li><li>Build strong creative and critical thinking, and problem-solving skills. </li><li>Apply foundational knowledge to problems in industry and society. </li><li>Use this qualification as a pathway to further studies, including a masters. </li></ul>  ',
