    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>Master the tools and techniques shaping the future of immersive media content. Our Graduate Diploma in Immersive Media Technologies gives you advanced skills to enable you to design and develop interactive experiences that span cutting-edge Virtual, Augmented and Mixed Reality (VR, AR, and MR) technologies and beyond. </p><p>Explore how immersive media transforms industries and enhances engagement, from entertainment to education. Learn to combine creative content production with technical expertise, and gain insights into user interaction and design. Expand your skill set by exploring complementary study areas and refining your creative problem-solving abilities. </p><p>Prepare to meet the growing demand for creative professionals in immersive media and shape the future of content delivery in a rapidly evolving field. </p> Key features <ul><li>Master the technologies behind Virtual, Augmented and Mixed Reality (VR, AR, and MR).</li><li>Enter a fast-growing industry where skilled professionals are in short supply.</li><li>Customise your learning with electives that match your career goals.</li><li>Combine creative and technical knowledge to craft next-level interactive experiences.</li><li>Re-define how entertainment and education are consumed with immersive innovations.</li><li>Equip yourself for roles in gaming, media production, education and emerging tech industries. </li></ul>  ',
