UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>Our Graduate Diploma in Marketing is a one-year degree designed to advance and refine your marketing skills. Be equipped to make strategic decisions to prepare you for future marketing leadership roles. </p><p>You’ll develop effective marketing strategies for diverse audiences. Identify trends, analyse consumer behaviour, examine analytical data, and communicate confidently. Study leadership and entrepreneurship and build a specialised skillset to equip you to lead on a global scale. </p><p>Gain first-hand, practical experience with a market research project and learn the marketing principles that are valuable across many business sectors – transferable to many roles and industries. Drive growth with your advanced communication and analytical skills and unlock senior marketing positions or start an exciting new career. </p> Key features <ul><li>Develop advanced strategic thinking and leadership skills. </li><li>Learn to apply innovative analytical tools and techniques. </li><li>Gain deep insights into international pressures and global markets. </li><li>Understand the latest data and trends in marketing. </li><li>Advance your leadership skills and widen your career prospects. </li><li>Build strong business and marketing research skills.</li></ul>  ',
