UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>Adelaide University’s Graduate Diploma in Nursing will help you meet the challenges in modern Australian healthcare. </p><p>This graduate diploma gives you the flexibility to choose your own study pathway that best relates to your clinical practice. Prepare for an elevated scope of practice and work duties. Choose electives that will provide you with advanced care skills in specialist areas. Sharpen your leadership skills and integrate the latest research and clinical evidence into your practice. </p><p>Designed to fit around your life and existing clinical practice, you can study both online and part-time. You’ll also engage in workshops with other registered nurses and industry leaders – allowing you to make valuable connections and broaden your networks. </p><p>Graduate with the skills to make a difference in your workplace and step into advanced clinical roles to meet Australia’s needs. </p> Key features <ul><li>Deepen your knowledge to enter advanced areas of clinical nursing practice. </li><li>Participate in workshops alongside industry-aligned peers and academics. </li><li>Choose part-time and online study options to fit your studies around your work. </li><li>Apply practical skills in real-world environments. </li><li>Use this degree to build upon your previous study, or work towards a higher qualification. </li><li>Develop skills to act as a leader in your workplace.</li></ul>  ',
