ours (AQF level 8) degree or equivalent from a recognised higher education institution; OR</li><li>A completed nested or related graduate certificate (AQF level 8) or higher or equivalent from a recognised higher education institution; OR</li><li>A completed Advanced Diploma (AQF level 6) or higher in a related field from a registered training organisation (RTO).</li> <p><b>Recognition of prior learning</b></p> <ul><li>Adelaide University is committed to recognising the contribution of students’ prior learning towards their program requirements. Credit may be granted for formal, informal, and non-formal learning. Visit the <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/how-to-apply/entry-pathways/credit/">Credit for previous study</a> page for more information.</li><li>Answer a few simple questions with our online <a href="https://apps.adelaide.edu.au/public/creditassessor/">Credit Assessor</a> to see what credit you could get.</li></ul> <p><b>Recognition of prior learning</b></p><ul><li>Adelaide University is committed to recognising the contribution of students’ prior learning towards their program requirements. Credit may be granted for formal, informal, and non-formal learning. Visit the <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/how-to-apply/entry-pathways/credit/">Credit for previous study</a> page for more information.</li><li>Answer a few simple questions with our online <a href="https://apps.adelaide.edu.au/public/creditassessor/">Credit Assessor</a> to see what credit you could get.</li></ul><li>Adelaide University is committed to recognising the contribution of students’ prior learning towards their program requirements. Credit may be granted for formal, informal, and non-formal learning. Visit the <a href="https://adelaide.edu.au/study/how-to-apply/entry-pathways/credit/">Credit for previous study</a> page for more information.</li><li>Answer a few simple questions with our online <a href="https://apps.adelaide.edu.au/public/creditassessor/">Credit Assessor</a> to see what credit you could get.</li>',
