UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>The Graduate Diploma in Technology, Innovation and Entrepreneurship empowers you to become a catalyst for transformative change in the fast-paced world of technology driven business. Gain the cross-disciplinary expertise to bridge the gap between visionary ideas and real-world impact.</p><p>Immerse yourself in cutting-edge innovation concepts and entrepreneurial strategies. Develop the expertise to identify emerging technologies and translate them into market-ready solutions. Develop your skills in data analytics, ethical decision-making and persuasive communication.</p><p>You''ll master the art of strategic innovation management, learn to navigate complex commercialisation pathways and lead groundbreaking projects from idea through to implementation.</p><p>Graduate prepared to drive the future of technology and business, equipped to make a lasting impact across industries. Be at the forefront of innovation, shaping a more dynamic and sustainable future.</p> Key features <ul><li>Learn to transform groundbreaking ideas into real-world solutions that can revolutionise industries.</li><li>Develop a forward-thinking mindset that anticipates emerging technologies and identifies game-changing opportunities before they become mainstream.</li><li>Bridge the gap between cutting-edge research and commercial success, equipping you to lead transformative projects.</li><li>Understand how to navigate complex commercialisation pathways, convince investors and build resilient business models and strategies.</li><li>Cultivate the skills to not just adapt to change but drive it as an innovative influencer.</li><li>Prepare to solve real-world challenges by developing the communication, analytical and ethical skills needed to create technologies and businesses that genuinely improve people''s lives.</li></ul>  ',
    course_duration_per_week = 52,
    offshore_tuition_fee = 50500,
    onshore_tuition_fee = NULL,
