UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>This degree will build your knowledge in a range of business disciplines, while developing advanced skills in analytics. Explore fundamental business principles in economics, accounting and finance. Then, learn the higher-level concepts and tools essential for proficiency in business analytics, including managing big data, data visualisation, predictive analytics and text analytics. Tackle big questions in the field: What are future trends in analytics technology? How can we better integrate AI and machine learning? What are the ethical considerations of the sector? </p><p>The curriculum includes industry-related projects to sharpen your research and analytical skills. Graduate with sophisticated problem-solving and decision-making abilities, equipped for dynamic careers in business and management.</p> Key features <ul><li>Study under top academics in business analytics. </li><li>Learn to analyse, interpret and communicate data to inform decision-making. </li><li>Build foundational business knowledge across economics, accounting and finance. </li><li>Complete industry projects to develop your research and analysis skills. </li><li>Choose electives to suit your career aspirations and interests. </li><li>Prepare for the modern business environment with artificial intelligence courses. </li></ul>  ',
