UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>Design and develop amazing virtual, mixed and augmented reality experiences in our Master of Immersive Media Technologies. </p><p>You’ll learn all about interactive design and gain advanced technical skills for developing digital assets using: </p><ul><li>3D modelling </li><li>Photogrammetry </li><li>Digital sculpting </li><li>Material painting and texturing </li><li>Sound design/engineering </li><li>Scripting </li><li>AI tools. </li></ul><li>3D modelling </li><li>Photogrammetry </li><li>Digital sculpting </li><li>Material painting and texturing </li><li>Sound design/engineering </li><li>Scripting </li><li>AI tools. </li><p>You’ll also gain a comprehensive understanding of the physiological and ergonomic implications of immersive technology design – examining how these factors can enhance or inhibit immersion and access. </p><p>Deeply practical, you’ll put your learning into practice with hands-on projects and real-world learning throughout your studies. </p><p>Emerge with the expertise ready for immersive media tech-focused roles in areas like entertainment, education and healthcare. </p> Key features <ul><li>Work with cutting-edge technologies to craft fully interactive digital experiences. </li><li>Learn about the physiological and ergonomic elements of immersive technology design. </li><li>Explore the global immersive media industry and its ethical challenges. </li><li>Undertake a research project to build highly transferable critical thinking, problem-solving and communication skills. </li><li>Prepare yourself for exciting careers where art and technology intersect. </li><li>Graduate as an expert in a field experiencing increasing demand for skilled professionals. </li></ul>  ',
    course_duration_per_week = 104,
    offshore_tuition_fee = 95600,
    onshore_tuition_fee = NULL,
    enrolment_fee = NULL,
    materials_fee = NULL,
